Warning [L0203]: `use textkit#1.4;` isn't pinned to an exact version
  --> tests/ui/inline_dep_unpinned/main.jet:5:12
    |
  5 | use textkit#1.4
    |            ^^^^
 Why: an inline script dependency has no lockfile until you run `jet fetch --lock`; a loose selector (`1.4` rather than `1.4.2`) can resolve to a different version on a fresh clone.
 Fix: write the exact version Jet resolved (`use textkit#<major.minor.patch>;`), or run `jet fetch --lock` to pin it in `<script>.lock`.
